Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Telegram Pro: features

- Faster downloads/uploads (bigger parts, more parallel requests)
- Whole-chat translation without Premium, Nekogram providers,
  translation style, show original, target language, do-not-translate, auto-translate
- Telegram Pro settings screen; hide Premium/Stars/Business/Gift and Help blocks

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
